<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9193] ML TF Integration: Python process still running after node sigkill shutdown</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9193</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. Running gird&lt;br/&gt;
2. Fill caches with training data&lt;br/&gt;
3. Run&#160;python script&lt;br/&gt;
4. Gird run several python processes on each node&lt;br/&gt;
5. Kill SIGNKILL one node&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Processes restore on other nodes&lt;br/&gt;
Script is doing rerun&lt;br/&gt;
But python processes which was created by killed node are still running&lt;/p&gt;</description>
